{"slug":"/components/charts","title":"Animated Chart Components for React — Planes","desc":"React chart components with shader and dither fills, no charting library: area, bars, lines, streamgraph, donut, pie, gauge, heatmap, bar list, stat tiles.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:px-10 lg:px-14 xl:px-16\"><section><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl pb-10 pt-2 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Animated Chart Components for React</h1><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Charts built by hand in SVG and canvas, filled with the same liquid and dither shaders as the rest of the catalog. An area chart and bars whose ink flows, a multi-series line chart, a streamgraph of stacked shader bands, a donut, pie, gauge, heatmap and ranked bar list rendered as halftone print, and a row of stat tiles with sparklines. Each one has hover detail, keyboard access, and a screen-reader description of the data.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] text-muted-foreground/70\">10<!-- --> components ·<!-- --> <a class=\"underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components\">Browse all components</a></p></div><h2 class=\"sr-only\">Components</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 p-1 transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-secondary\" href=\"/components/shader-area\"><div class=\"aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted\"><img src=\"/thumbs/shader-area.webp\" alt=\"Shader Area preview\" width=\"960\" height=\"557\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></div><div class=\"px-1.5 pb-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground p-1\">Shader Area</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" st